openpair
Copyright 2026 The openpair authors

This project is an independent implementation, in Rust, of a node compatible with
the "Personal AI Router" (PAIR) LAN AI-inference clustering protocol.

Upstream project
----------------
NVIDIA Personal AI Router — https://github.com/NVIDIA/Personal-AI-Router
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

openpair reproduces the PAIR protocol's interoperability contract (network
service identifiers, message field names, wire framing, and the cryptographic
parameters required to interoperate) so that it can interoperate with PAIR
clusters. Portions of that contract, and protocol details, are derived from and
informed by the upstream project. openpair is itself licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE); when using or redistributing material derived
from the upstream project, comply with the upstream Apache-2.0 license and retain
the upstream attributions and NOTICE. See the upstream repository for the
original work and its NOTICE / Third-Party Software Notices.

